OL,3,GNEWSAOil prices create 'huge worry' as
OL,4,Awinter looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of households who rely on
OL,7,Fheating oil could face a fresh squeeze
OL,8,Fon their finances this winter as global
OL,9,Ftensions continue to push up fuel
OL,10,Fprices, a councillor has warned.
OL,12,FCheryl Cottle-Hunkin, Devon County
OL,13,FCouncil's cabinet member for rural
OL,14,Faffairs and broadband, said rising oil
OL,15,Fprices were creating anxiety for
OL,16,Ffamilies already struggling with the
OL,17,Fcost of living.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
