OL,3,GNEWSAOil prices create 'huge worry' as
OL,4,Awinter looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe warning comes after reports
OL,7,Fhighlighted how the conflict in Iran
OL,8,Fhad driven up heating oil and fuel
OL,9,Fcosts, with the price of heating oil
OL,10,Frising from about 60p a litre before
OL,11,Fthe conflict to about 97p a litre
OL,12,Faccording to price comparison website
OL,13,FBoiler Juice.
OL,15,FCottle-Hunkin, a fifth-generation
OL,16,Ffarmer from near Great Torrington, said
OL,17,Fthe increases had also hit farming
OL,18,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
